## SQ-ABD-01
@group B
@commands Boot, then `/dumpall` and look up `abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cooked_perch_slice` and `.../cooked_pike_slice`
@pass Both gone; `creativedelight:smelting/cooked_perch_slice_from_perch_slice` and `.../cooked_pike_slice_from_pike_slice` present, experience 0.35, cookingtime 200, same input and output; the smoking and campfire recipes (`creativedelight:smoking/...`, `creativedelight:campfirecooking/..._from_..._slice`) present; no error in `logs/latest.log`
@fails Depends on: CD jar. Recipe ids renamed `smelting/cooked_<fish>_slice_from_<fish>_slice` (recipes/all.csv 2026-11-19; r1120nv batch fault)
@reviewed 2026-11-20
> cdevtest recipes abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cooked_
> cdevtest rdetail cooked_perch_slice
> cdevtest rdetail cooked_pike_slice
expect verb=recipes text=abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cooked_ n=0\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:smelting/cooked_perch_slice_from_perch_slice serializer=minecraft:smelting\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:smelting/cooked_pike_slice_from_pike_slice serializer=minecraft:smelting\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:smoking/cooked_perch_slice_from_perch_slice serializer=minecraft:smoking\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:campfirecooking/cooked_pike_slice_from_pike_slice serializer=minecraft:campfire_cooking\b
look experience 0.35 and cookingtime 200 are not printed (part=fields only for public fields): check the /dumpall recipe dump; the smoking and campfire lines unchanged
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ .*error=

## SQ-ABD-02 | Upgrade Aquatic driftwood salvaging moved to CD ids
@group B
@commands Same boot: look up the salvaging ids in the dump
@pass `abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cutting/driftwood_door`, `_sign`, `_trapdoor` gone; `creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/driftwood_furniture` (10 items incl. `abnormals_delight:driftwood_cabinet`, 0.75 driftwood planks, axe), `.../driftwood_chest_boat`, `.../driftwood_furnace_boat`, `.../<wood>_furnace_boat` for the 9 vanilla woods (crimson and warped give `boatload:` boats), `.../crimson_boat`, `.../warped_boat`, `.../crimson_chest_boat`, `.../warped_chest_boat` present; no `fdCutting` warning in `logs/latest.log`
@fails Depends on: CD jar
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest recipes abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cutting/driftwood_
> cdevtest rdetail salvaging/driftwood_furniture
> cdevtest recipes salvaging/ max=500
expect verb=recipes text=abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cutting/driftwood_ n=0\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/driftwood_furniture serializer=
expect verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/driftwood_chest_boat\b
expect verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/driftwood_furnace_boat\b
expect verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/crimson_boat\b
expect verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/warped_boat\b
expect verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/crimson_chest_boat\b
expect verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/warped_chest_boat\b
count verb=recipes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/[a-z_]+_furnace_boat result= >= 10
kjsreject (?i)fdCutting.*(warn|error)
bootreject (?i)fdCutting.*warn
look driftwood_furniture rdetail: input lists the 10 driftwood items incl. abnormals_delight:driftwood_cabinet (first 3 + "/+7"), result driftwood planks, axe tool; crimson / warped furnace boats take boatload: boats
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ .*error=

