expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/pike_with_beetroot serializer=\S+ result=\S+ ingredients=\S*pickerelweed\S*pickerelweed
look 1.0 xp and 200 ticks: a part=fields line shows them only if the recipe class has public fields (else recipe dump or JEI)
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ .*error=

